{"type":"standard","title":"Bill Hagerty","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Bill Hagerty</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q27734214","titles":{"canonical":"Bill_Hagerty","normalized":"Bill Hagerty","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Bill Hagerty</span></span>"},"pageid":52090404,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Bill_Hagerty_senatorial_portrait.jpg/330px-Bill_Hagerty_senatorial_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":412},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Bill_Hagerty_senatorial_portrait.jpg/3840px-Bill_Hagerty_senatorial_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":5000,"height":6246},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1368095724","tid":"fdbaf2b7-91f8-11f1-930a-6611523d8237","timestamp":"2026-08-07T00:43:22Z","description":"American politician and diplomat (born 1959)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Hagerty","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Hagerty?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Hagerty?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Bill_Hagerty"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Hagerty","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Bill_Hagerty","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Hagerty?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Bill_Hagerty"}},"extract":"William Francis Hagerty IV is an American politician, businessman, and diplomat serving as the junior United States senator from Tennessee since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he served as the 30th United States ambassador to Japan from 2017 to 2019 under President Donald Trump.","extract_html":"<p><b>William Francis Hagerty</b> <b>IV</b> is an American politician, businessman, and diplomat serving as the junior United States senator from Tennessee since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, he served as the 30th United States ambassador to Japan from 2017 to 2019 under President Donald Trump.</p>"}